Ohngea PBX — Modern PBX for teams.

Speak. Connect. Ohngea. Clean-room successor to legacy PBX concepts:
FastAPI + SQLModel + pydantic-xml + PostgreSQL 18 (HASH partitioning
domain_id 32 + RLS FORCE) + React Vite + Tailwind shadcn + FreeSWITCH
mod_xml_curl. Full REST /api/v1, mobile PWA, per-tenant plugins.

Features:
- Multi-tenant RLS tenant isolation via JWT domain_id
- Extensions, dialplans, gateways, SIP profiles, IVR, devices,
  CDR analytics, recordings (S3), voicemail, conferences, fax,
  ring groups, time conditions, contacts
- FreeSWITCH via mod_xml_curl + ESL
- Valkey cache/broker, Celery workers

WWW: https://github.com/ohngea/ohngea
